note How a name on the command line becomes a symbol. Plain names match every symbol of that name across files; Owner::name narrows to an impl owner or a file stem, path/file.rs:name to a file. Commands that read (callers, callees, tree) take every match; commands that write a step (path-add, promote) demand exactly one and list the candidates otherwise.

